{"authors": [], "discovered_at": "2026-09-07T00:50:57.210975Z", "id": "github:release:1301140808:release:383438263", "kind": "release", "matched_terms": [], "metadata": {"action": "released", "draft": false, "forks": 1266, "prerelease": false, "stars": 15392, "stars_delta": 89, "tag_name": "v2.0.0"}, "organization": "img2threejs", "priority": {"source": 0.5}, "published_at": "2026-09-06T02:33:15Z", "related_items": [], "scores": {}, "source": "github", "source_id": "1301140808:release:383438263", "summary": "**The Plugin Update.** The plugin ecosystem \u2014 domain registry, img2 harness, plugin-served domains \u2014 ships as its own major, pulled forward from the original Procedural World bundle.\n\n### Breaking\n- **`animated-character` is served by the installed [plugin-character](https://github.com/img2threejs/plugin-character)** (`img2 add img2threejs/plugin-character`, harness >= 0.2.3). The in-repo domain module is removed; without the plugin the profile fails loud naming what is available, and an in-flight workspace is refused while the provider is absent, resuming unchanged on reinstall.\n- **CS2 is extracted into [plugin-cs2](https://github.com/img2threejs/plugin-cs2)** and **a domain is no longer inferred from the target's name** \u2014 `detect_cs2_intent` and its 17-keyword table are removed; declare the domain (`--profile cs2`) instead.\n- Local spec search defaults to `core_3d` rather than `cs2`; `objectClass.cs2` is replaced by `objectClass.domain: \"<id>\"`; `weapon-v1.4` no longer requires a CS2 marker to pass strict validation.\n\n### Added\n- **A domain registry** (`forge/_shared/domains/`): in-repo modules and installed plugins register identically, `--profile` choices derive from what is actually present, and an unregistered profile fails loud naming what is available.\n- **The [img2 harness](https://github.com/img2threejs/img2)** (`img2 install / add / list / doctor / sync / capabilities`) owns plugin installation, host skill links, and drift detection across agent hosts.\n- Pull-based spec augmentation with raise-only quality floors, the emission-target socket with provenance, and per-plugin blocking gates.\n\n**Official plugins:** [plugin-cs2](https://github.com/img2threejs/plugin-cs2) \u00b7 [plugin-character](https://github.com/img2threejs/plugin-character) \u00b7 [plugin-img2glb](https://github.com/img2threejs/plugin-img2glb) \u00b7 [plugin-hello-cube](https://github.com/img2threejs/plugin-hello-cube) (reference)\n\nFull details: [CHANGELOG.md \u00a7 2.0.0](https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n\n## What's Changed\n* Lab/cs2 plugin by @kokorolx in https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/pull/130\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/compare/v1.5.2...v2.0.0\n", "title": "img2threejs/img2threejs 2.0.0: The Plugin Update", "topics": ["image_to_3d"], "updated_at": "2026-09-06T02:35:28Z", "url": "https://github.com/img2threejs/img2threejs/releases/tag/v2.0.0", "venue": null}
